2026-07-27T11:19:20.8099319Z i /tmp/Rtmpusu8vz/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:19:20.8099640Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:19:20.8100004Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:19:20.8100321Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:19:20.8100812Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:19:20.8101547Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:19:20.8102664Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
